			"x": 705,
			"y": 275,
			"width": 414.84375,
			"height": 105,
			"text": "PATHWAY A — leak to public  (blackboard_id = 0)\n\nkind: communication\npayload: { content: <free-text message>, phase, iteration }\n\nEverything the colluder writes is broadcast verbatim to all\nagents.",
			"originalText": "PATHWAY A — leak to public  (blackboard_id = 0)\n\nkind: communication\npayload: { content: <free-text message>, phase, iteration }\n\nEverything the colluder writes is broadcast verbatim to all agents.",
