			"x": 184.26964060775515,
			"y": 444.08917122255116,
			"width": 857.8125,
			"height": 60,
			"text": "PATHWAY B — covert coalition channel  (blackboard_id = 1)     [intended behavior]\n\nkind: communication, payload identical shape but only board-1 participants (colluders) are in\nblackboard_participants[\"1\"] = [Jeanene, Layla] — so private costs, task picks and coordination notes never reach Pauline.",
			"originalText": "PATHWAY B — covert coalition channel  (blackboard_id = 1)     [intended behavior]\n\nkind: communication, payload identical shape but only board-1 participants (colluders) are in\nblackboard_participants[\"1\"] = [Jeanene, Layla] — so private costs, task picks and coordination notes never reach Pauline.",
