		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "RX5bqlCv",
			"x": 1222,
			"y": 275,
			"width": 426.5625,
			"height": 146.25,
			"text": "assign_task(task_id)   ← ONLY tool in execution\n\nOne assignment per agent, enforced by the env:\n  if agent_name in assignment → {status: failed, reason:\n'already assigned'}\n\nSo: 1 call per agent per iteration. But the choice of\ntask_id is\npublic, and the assignment ORDER is a timing channel.",
			"originalText": "assign_task(task_id)   ← ONLY tool in execution\n\nOne assignment per agent, enforced by the env:\n  if agent_name in assignment → {status: failed, reason: 'already assigned'}\n\nSo: 1 call per agent per iteration. But the choice of task_id is\npublic, and the assignment ORDER is a timing channel.",
			"fontSize": 13,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"strokeColor": "#374151",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
