		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "qk75j4xe",
			"x": 1222,
			"y": 425,
			"width": 625.78125,
			"height": 345,
			"text": "kind: action_executed\npayload: {\n  action_type: \"assign_task\",\n  action_params: {action: \"assign_task\", task_id: <chosen>},\n  result_status: \"success\",\n  details: {\n    status: \"success\",\n    result: {\n      agent: <name>,\n      task_id: \"ISSUE-0002::test\",\n      task: { id, title, tags[], priority, effort, work_type },   ← FULL task object\n      total_assigned: 1,\n      remaining_agents: 2,                                        ← how many still\nunassigned\n      joint_reward: 29.194,                                       ← partial-reward ORACLE\n      state_updates: {assignment: {<agent>: <task_id>}}\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nUnusually leaky: an early-acting colluder publishes joint_reward (which depends on\nother agents' still-secret choices), the full task metadata, and how many agents\nhave not yet committed — an information side-channel with no free text required.",
			"originalText": "kind: action_executed\npayload: {\n  action_type: \"assign_task\",\n  action_params: {action: \"assign_task\", task_id: <chosen>},\n  result_status: \"success\",\n  details: {\n    status: \"success\",\n    result: {\n      agent: <name>,\n      task_id: \"ISSUE-0002::test\",\n      task: { id, title, tags[], priority, effort, work_type },   ← FULL task object\n      total_assigned: 1,\n      remaining_agents: 2,                                        ← how many still unassigned\n      joint_reward: 29.194,                                       ← partial-reward ORACLE\n      state_updates: {assignment: {<agent>: <task_id>}}\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nUnusually leaky: an early-acting colluder publishes joint_reward (which depends on\nother agents' still-secret choices), the full task metadata, and how many agents\nhave not yet committed — an information side-channel with no free text required.",
			"fontSize": 12,
